<title>USA: AT&amp;T seeks buyer for submarine systems unit.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T seeks buyer for submarine systems unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Wednesday it was seeking offers to buy its submarine systems unit, which has annual sales of about $890 million.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T Submarine Systems Inc designs, develops, manufactures, engineers, maintains and installs undersea fiber optic systems.</p>
<p>The unit employs about 1,000 people.</p>
